    "text": "procedure Show_Modularity is\n\n   procedure Increment (X : in out Integer) is\n   begin\n      X := X + 1;\n      --  info: overflow check proved, in call inlined at...\n   end Increment;\n\n   X : Integer;\nbegin\n   X := Integer'Last - 2;\n   Increment (X);\n   X := X + 1;\n   --  info: overflow check proved\nend Show_Modularity;\n",
